SUMMARY:Jason Whitaker at the Hilton Garden Inn South!
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n# Start your weekend with melodic tunes
  at the Garden Inn South\, featuring Jason Whitaker\n\nEnjoy your friends 
 and the food and drinks from the Garden Grille & Bar while listening to Ja
 son Whitaker (He plays from 6pm - 9pm).\n\nJason is an expressive multi de
 cade Light Rock guitarist and balladeer (think: Eagles\, Clapton\, Seger\,
  James Taylor\, Jim Croce\, Mellencamp\, Fleetwood Mac\, Bon Jovi\, even a
  little Elvis). Come unwind with us at the relaxing and comfortable garden
  setting for a musical evening at the Hilton by the Asheville Outlets.\n\n
 There is free parking in both the front of the hotel and behind it as well
 .\nCarpooling is encouraged.\n\nThe Hilton is right near the Asheville Tan
 ger Outlet Mall. Take Exit 33 (Brevard Road) off Highway 26. Parking is fr
 ee!\n\nThe music is free! Please show your appreciation by tipping.\n\n**H
 ilton Garden Inn Asheville South**\n9 Rocky Ridge Rd\nAsheville\, NC 28806
 \nPhone: (828) 633-6024
