SUMMARY:Strawberry Gap Hike
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n**Hey y’all! Let’s** **go hike** **
 the** **Strawberry** **Gap** **trail in Gerton NC! This is a 5.2 mile out 
 and back with elevation gain of 1158’. All of the elevation gain is leav
 ing from the parking lot. The top of the mountain is an open field with vi
 ews for miles\, including Bearwallow Mountain. There is a beautiful overlo
 ok on the way as well**\n\n**Make sure to sign up only if you can handle t
 he elevation gain starting out from the parking lot**\n\n**The trail will 
 have some rocks and roots\, so wear sturdy footwear. Bring plenty of water
 **\n\n**Dogs are not allowed on this trail**\n\n**Everyone pack a picnic l
 unch and we’ll hang out before heading back down**\n\n**Strawberry Gap T
 rail on AllTrails**\n**https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/north-carolina/s
 trawberry-gap-trail?sh=pp8ici&utm_medium=trail_share&utm_source=alltrails_
 virality**\n\n**https://maps.app.goo.gl/b4heKpyZ92ztjDFY8?g_st=ic**
